      equipment: '54 Cego cards, scoring chips or paper.',
      dealing: 'A 12-card talon (Dapp) is dealt first (usually in two batches of 6). The remaining cards are dealt to the players (7 cards each for 6 players, 6 cards each for 7 players).',
